WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.000
I've often thought about economic opportunity as a house.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:47.000
The labor market is one of the least transparent and least dynamic markets humans have ever created.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Some people were born in that house, some came through the front door with a degree, and others snuck through by starting a business.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:33.000
AI is going to open that door, and it can help everyone learn and build.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Everyone now doesn't start with deficits. They start with strengths.
